cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Featuresmith in your research or projects, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "Featuresmith"
abstract: >
  Featuresmith is a deterministic feature engineering and data quality platform
  for Python. It provides a unified SDK and CLI for loading tabular datasets,
  profiling them, detecting quality issues, and building reliable preprocessing
  workflows. Featuresmith is designed as a reusable engine — not a one-shot
  report generator — with strong typing, an extensible rule engine, and an
  AI-ready architecture.
